las/michigan/luce-county"],["ARC or PLC in Luce County","/arc-plc/michigan/luce-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs 75 years, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 33 of them. In 2025 the middle hit 171% of normal in February to March and dropped to 55% in September to October. So far in 2026 on the middle, May to June sits at 80% and June to July at 78%.</p>"}
